# Play test of the plan 'The Rainmakers' (CIPlay plan_rainmakers, in a test world 'CI ...'): a main story in place of
# Raft's - each station's frequency comes when the one before is done (its quest), it is tuned to on the Receiver and
# played to its end with its own test.
plan The Rainmakers
tune weir
include hailstone_weir.play
tune silos
include cirrus_silo_farm.play
tune kites
include the_kite_meadow.play
tune fogworks
include the_fogworks.play
tune reservoir
include vaporhold_reservoir.play
tune array
include thunderhead_array.play
tune kilns
include the_sleet_kilns.play
tune club
include the_isobar_club.play
tune engine
include the_rain_engine.play
expect blueprints
plan end
